                                                "sense_id": "8eb6ee54-fd36-381b-9979-0476a5d4bef4",
                                                "text": "Mr. Dawe further calls his voyage “A Record of some Strange Doings at Sea.” They are strange doings, in fact, and yet not as novel as might be expected. They involve mutiny, piracy, shipwreck, and fights with Savages […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
